5,1,1,talk,Minako,,We need a system that is fair and sustainable. I suggest we look at the actual costs and usage patterns first.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"I agree. It is not just about the money, but the social friction. We should see why these arrangements usually fail.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Asuka,,I care about the daily reliability. I want to know why the car is often unavailable or dirty when I need it.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shion,,Logic dictates we start with the numbers. We have been guessing for too long; we need the real figures.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,I... I just want to know how much time we spend arguing over the schedule. It feels like too much.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Minako,,"@Benjamin, that is a good point. I will look into the fixed costs and the general usage patterns.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,I will investigate the external perspectives and the internal friction regarding the figures.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Asuka,,I will check the state of the car at handover and the repeating weekly trips.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Shion,,I will take the fuel receipts and the tax and insurance papers.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,I'll look at the hours in the diary and the trial of recording every run.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
