30,2,1,talk,Minako,,"The fixed costs are quite high, and the usage is heavily skewed toward weekends and holidays.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
31,2,1,talk,Benjamin,,It seems that constant favor-asking and auditing each other's spending are the primary causes of resentment.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,2,1,talk,Asuka,,"It is worse than I thought. Weekly commitments are collapsing, and the car is often returned empty and dirty.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,2,1,talk,Shion,,The fuel spending is incredibly lopsided. A few of us are paying for almost everything while others contribute nothing.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,2,1,talk,Daisuke,,Recording every single run is exhausting. It takes an hour a week just to manage the paperwork.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,2,2,talk,Minako,,"@Shion, if the fuel is that uneven, a simple split is not fair. We need a more precise method.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,2,talk,Benjamin,,"But @Daisuke's point is crucial. If the method is too precise, we will spend all our time auditing.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,2,talk,Asuka,,Precision doesn't help if the car isn't there for my weekly trips. We need a guarantee of availability.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,2,talk,Shion,,We cannot ignore the financial imbalance. Someone is subsidizing the others significantly.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,2,talk,Daisuke,,I just don't want to spend my evenings calculating kilometers and receipts.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,3,talk,Minako,,We need to balance the need for fairness with the need for simplicity.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,3,talk,Benjamin,,"Exactly. The goal is to remove the ""favor"" aspect and the ""policing"" aspect.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,3,talk,Asuka,,"A fixed schedule would solve my availability issue, but would it be fair?","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,3,talk,Shion,,"Only if the payment reflects the actual usage, or if the days are balanced.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,3,talk,Daisuke,,A fixed day sounds easier than a diary.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,4,talk,Minako,,"Let's consider the options then. We need to decide between fixed days, a booking system, or a primary keeper.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,4,talk,Benjamin,,"A booking system is logical, but as @Daisuke noted, the administration can be a burden.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,4,talk,Asuka,,A primary keeper might be too much pressure on one person.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,4,talk,Shion,,I prefer a system where the costs are transparent and tied to use.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,4,talk,Daisuke,,I just want it to be simple.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
