55,3,1,talk,Minako,,"Option A gives us stability and a fixed cost, though it might not be perfectly ""fair"" for every single trip.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
56,3,1,talk,Benjamin,,"Option B is the most rational for costs, but it risks the ""auditing"" friction I found in my research.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
57,3,1,talk,Asuka,,Option A solves my problem with the weekly trips. I would know exactly when the car is mine.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
58,3,1,talk,Shion,,Option B is the only one that addresses the fuel imbalance I discovered.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
59,3,1,talk,Daisuke,,Option A sounds the least stressful. No more calculating every single run.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
60,3,2,talk,Minako,,"@Shion, if we go with A, we can adjust the monthly share to be more equitable.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,2,talk,Benjamin,,Option C is too risky; it creates a power imbalance that usually sours these groups.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,2,talk,Asuka,,I agree. I don't want to have to ask permission every time I need to leave.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,2,talk,Shion,,"If we choose A, we are essentially accepting a level of subsidy. I find that illogical.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,2,talk,Daisuke,,"But the time we save is worth something too, right?","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,3,talk,Minako,,I think the peace of mind and the lack of administrative burden make Option A the strongest choice.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,3,talk,Benjamin,,I am inclined to agree. Reducing the social friction is more important than perfect accounting.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,3,talk,Asuka,,I vote for A. It provides the reliability I need for my midweek mornings.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,3,talk,Shion,,"I still prefer B, but if everyone else hates the paperwork, A is the only alternative.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,3,talk,Daisuke,,I'm definitely for A.,"{""words"":4,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,4,talk,Minako,,It seems we have a consensus forming.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,4,talk,Benjamin,,Indeed. Let us move to the vote.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,4,talk,Asuka,,Agreed.,"{""words"":1,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,4,talk,Shion,,Fine. Let's see the result.,"{""words"":5,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
